{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15108","headline":"华山南庙 · 李益","name":"华山南庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阴山临古道，古庙闭山碧。\n落日春草中，搴芳荐瑶席。\n明灵达精意，髣髴如不隔。\n岩雨神降时，回飙入松栢。\n常闻坑儒後，此地返秦璧。\n自古害忠良，神其辅宗祏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15108.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15108","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}